---
description: >-
  EBNF syntax (railroad-ebnf-beta) covering repetition (`*`), grouping, and
  alternation (`|`) in an expression/term/number/digit grammar.
---
railroad-ebnf-beta
expression = term ( "+" term | "-" term )* ;
term = number | "(" expression ")" ;
number = digit+ ;
digit = "0" | "1" | "2" ;
